@startuml BinanceSpotFlow
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam defaultFontName Courier
skinparam shadowing false

actor "Arb Strategy" as Strategy
participant "Binance Spot Connector\n(binance_spot_connector_rust)" as Connector
participant "REST Trade API\nPOST /api/v3/order" as REST
participant "Matching Engine" as Engine
participant "Account Balances" as Accounts

Strategy -> Connector : Build order request\n(symbol=SOLUSDT, side=BUY)
Connector -> REST : Signed HTTP request\n(X-MBX-APIKEY, signature)
REST -> Engine : Route order for matching
Engine -> Accounts : Reserve balances
Engine --> REST : Execution report (orderId, status)
REST --> Connector : JSON response
Connector --> Strategy : Parse result\n(update positions)
Strategy -> Connector : Optionally poll ORDER status
Connector -> REST : GET /api/v3/order\n(signed)
REST -> Engine : Fetch state
Engine --> REST : Current fills + status
REST --> Connector : Order details
Connector --> Strategy : Report fill / failure

@enduml
